        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977390/extras/088f9be8e8627a7400f95bff2ed82359.avif?t=1780896565\" width=1232 height=706 /></span><br><strong>-STORY-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as the mysterious rebel pilot &quot;Sara Yong&quot;, a soldier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">of the N.W.E. She steals an experimental aircraft named &quot;Swan&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">as she tries to destroy a universal capsule called the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Emerald-Capsule&quot;... her reasons are still unknown....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>-GAMEPLAY-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play through 4 intense stages as you try to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">score as many gems as possible to fill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your &quot;Emerald-Chain&quot; with your &quot;Pierce Lance&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Select between &quot;Power&quot; and &quot;Speed&quot; to suit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">either a focused, high damage style or a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">blazing fast, twitchy style of play...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977390/extras/fce084803e0eaead27aaccc72aa17b46.avif?t=1780896565\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>-Crystal Rev Changes-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crystal rev introduces new balance changes to the game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">refining the less savory parts of Emerald Blue as well as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">adding new and fresh modes to keep the game alive...</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977390/extras/088f9be8e8627a7400f95bff2ed82359.avif?t=1780896565\" width=1232 height=706 /></span><br><strong>-STORY-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as the mysterious rebel pilot &quot;Sara Yong&quot;, a soldier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">of the N.W.E. She steals an experimental aircraft named &quot;Swan&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">as she tries to destroy a universal capsule called the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Emerald-Capsule&quot;... her reasons are still unknown....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>-GAMEPLAY-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play through 4 intense stages as you try to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">score as many gems as possible to fill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your &quot;Emerald-Chain&quot; with your &quot;Pierce Lance&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Select between &quot;Power&quot; and &quot;Speed&quot; to suit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">either a focused, high damage style or a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">blazing fast, twitchy style of play...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977390/extras/fce084803e0eaead27aaccc72aa17b46.avif?t=1780896565\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>-Crystal Rev Changes-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crystal rev introduces new balance changes to the game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">refining the less savory parts of Emerald Blue as well as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">adding new and fresh modes to keep the game alive...</p>",
